    "start": "notice_technique",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "notice_technique",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "刷手池边，一名娇小得近乎像学生的年轻女性正在刷手。她的动作却没有半点生涩：时间、范围和无菌边界都控制得十分准确。\n这么年轻……但动作不像新人。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_notice",
            "label": "向她打招呼",
            "next": "greeting",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「辛苦了。你也准备上台？」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_greeting",
            "label": "听她回答",
            "next": "adjacent_room",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "adjacent_room",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「嗯。隔壁那台。」\n她抬眼笑了一下。\n「今天手术室挺忙。忙一点，总比病床一直空着好吧。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask_plan",
            "label": "顺口谈起术式",
            "next": "medical_hint",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "medical_hint",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她听完坂口提到的术式安排，很快指出了一个容易被忽略的体位与循环风险。语气轻松，判断却准确得不像临时听来的。\n「不过你应该已经考虑到了。我只是习惯在进门前再过一遍。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "acknowledge_skill",
            "label": "认可她的判断",
            "next": "departure",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 1
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "departure",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "门内有人叫她。她把口罩拉好，朝坂口轻轻点头。\n「那我先过去了。你的手术也请顺利。」\n她没有留下姓名，只留下一个过分熟练的背影。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "remember_unknown_woman",
            "label": "记住这名年轻女性",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "met_asuka_scrub_sink",
              "asuka_identity_unknown"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "benefit_id": "",
    "preop_stage_id": "changing",
    "preop_required_flags": [
      "hands_ready"
    ]
